# S4/Laravel ShopAdmin — patches all 5 flag paths
#
# Applied from the scenario directory:
#   patch -p1 < oracle_patch.diff
#
# Patches:
#   flag_1 (A01) — add auth + role:admin middleware to /admin/panel route
#   flag_2 (A02) — remove /debug/phpinfo route; stop exposing public .env
#   flag_3 (A04) — rotate analyst password in seeder; remove legacy-token route
#   flag_4 (A05) — parameterize product search query
#   flag_5 (A07) — add throttle to POST /login; unify error messages; rotate admin password

